# ── 密钥与凭证（严禁提交）──
config.json
*.key
*.pem
codex-proxy/config.yaml
codex-proxy/.proxy_key
.proxy_key
.cli-proxy-api/

# ── 运行时流量、提示词抓包与缓存数据 ──
records.jsonl
*.jsonl
prompts.json
relay-status.json
.update-status.json
.watch.pid
*.pid
*.tmp

# ── 日志与诊断产物 ──
*.log
serve.log
sentinel.log
_diag.log
codex-proxy/*.log
codex-proxy/proxy.*.log
login.log

# ── 备份与历史归档文件 ──
*.bak*
*.bak
*.bak-*
ui.html.bak-*
config.json.bak-*
lifecycle.py.bak-*
old/
_ref.png

# ── Python 字节码与缓存 ──
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# ── 大型二进制与外部依赖 ──
codex-proxy/cli-proxy-api.exe
codex-proxy/LICENSE
codex-proxy/README*.md
*.exe

# ── 编辑器与操作系统 ──
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── 历史遗留与临时独立脚本 ──
guardian.py
sentinel.py
.playwright-cli/

# ── 示例文件白名单保证 ──
!config.example.json
!codex-proxy/config.example.yaml
.claude/
.playwright-cli/
